                                "sense_id": "a2dacbf7-383b-3024-ba49-78264100a301",
                                "text": "One of the best Old Fashioneds I have had was made with baconized bourbon. To make it, buy the smokiest cure of streaky bacon you can find – hickory smoked is best – and cook up enough for a good bacon sandwich."
